OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tackles anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour in Crediton
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town in Devon is joining other places
OL,7,Facross the county by banning public
OL,8,Fdrinking in order to crack down on
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FMid Devon District Council said it had
OL,12,Fintroduced a Public Space Protection
OL,13,FOrder (PSPO) in Crediton to give police
OL,14,Fextra powers to to tackle anti-social
OL,15,Fbehaviour and street drinking.
OL,17,FThe order will allow authorised
OL,18,Fofficers to disperse individuals who
OL,19,Fare causing a nuisance or disorder, and
OL,20,Fthe power to remove alcohol from people
OL,21,Fwho are drinking on the streets, before
OL,22,Fa situation escalates.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
