OL,3,GNEWSACouncil tackles anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour in Crediton
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsp Mark Arthurs said the PSPO was "an
OL,7,Fadditional tool" for police to use to
OL,8,F"challenge and tackle nuisance
OL,9,Fbehaviour that's upsetting and
OL,10,Fdistressing our communities".
